WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.850
5050cloud: Railway's workflow on your own servers.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.264
One command on a fresh VM installs everything.

3
00:00:09.614 --> 00:00:14.264
Create the owner account. This VM is the first host.

4
00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.864
Start from an empty canvas.

5
00:00:17.214 --> 00:00:24.364
Deploy a Docker image from the UI.

6
00:00:24.714 --> 00:00:30.364
Add Postgres in two clicks.

7
00:00:30.714 --> 00:00:39.364
Reference variables across services, like Railway.

8
00:00:39.714 --> 00:00:45.864
Generate a public HTTPS URL.

9
00:00:46.214 --> 00:00:48.464
It is live, with a certificate.

10
00:00:48.814 --> 00:00:53.490
Or push from your laptop with railway up. The build log streams live.

11
00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:58.490
Deploy logs for every deployment, in the console.

12
00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:05.990
Scale replicas and turn on Use all cores.

13
00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:11.490
Use all cores, measured.

14
00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:17.990
Costs a month, from list prices with the date.

15
00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:23.790
You run the server, and you keep the savings.

16
00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:27.790
Install it on your own server today.

